utton aria-label=\"Share on Email\" class=\"social-share__popup-btn\" data-link=\"mailto:?subject=Jammie%20Dodger%20owner%20tastes%20sweet%20success%20after%20return%20to%20profit&amp;body=https://www.cityam.com/jammie-dodger-owner-tastes-sweet-success-after-return-to-profit/\">\n<svg height=\"24\" viewbox=\"0 0 32 32\" width=\"24\"><title>Email</title><g id=\"Style_2\"><g><path d=\"M16,0C7.163,0,0,7.163,0,16c0,8.836,7.163,16,16,16s16-7.164,16-16C32,7.163,24.837,0,16,0z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></g><g><polygon fill=\"#FFFFFF\" points=\"6.518,21.815 11.707,15.291 6.518,12.119\"></polygon><polygon fill=\"#FFFFFF\" points=\"19.5,15.746 15.989,17.908 12.472,15.758 7.11,22.5 24.867,22.5   \"></polygon><polygon fill=\"#FFFFFF\" points=\"15.988,16.864 25.482,11.017 25.482,9.5 6.518,9.5 6.518,11.076\"></polygon><polygon fill=\"#FFFFFF\" points=\"20.263,15.276 25.482,21.843 25.482,12.062\"></polygon></g></g></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\tShare on Email\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n </div>\n</header>\n<figure class=\"article-header-featured-image\">\n<div class=\"notice-header notice-header--is-full-content-width notice-header--is-bordered\">\n<div id=\"inimage\" style=\"min-height: 0;\"></div>\n</div>\n<img alt=\"Freshly baked golden biscuits on a baking tray, showcasing a variety of shapes and textures, ideal for a breakfast feature\" class=\"media\" decoding=\"sync\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"495\" loading=\"eager\" sizes=\"(max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px\" src=\"https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?w=742\" srcset=\"https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg 1200w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=630,420 630w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=768,512 768w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=960,640 960w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=1107,738 1107w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=742,495 742w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=304,203 304w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/biscuits-e1771936522868.jpg?resize=75,50 75w\" width=\"742\"/> <figcaption>The company is back in profit</figcaption> </figure>\n<!-- Ads Injected --><p>Profit at the biscuits giant behind Jammie Dodgers and Wagon Wheels hit a sugar rush as the firm turned to a Strictly Come Dancing judge and a “Dubai-inspired” biscuit to boost revenue.</p><p>The group, which includes Burton’s Biscuit Company and Fox’s Biscuits, has <a cmp-ltrk=\"content-container\" cmp-ltrk-idx=\"0\" data-mrf-link=\"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/02086754\" href=\"https://find-and-update.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/02086754\" mrfobservableid=\"7317e86d-6a3d-4ad4-b550-78a04af8cb32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">posted</a> a nine per cent boost in revenue, to £695m for the twelve months to August 2025. </p><p>Fox’s Burton’s Companies (FBC) enlisted Strictly Come Dancing judge Craig Revel Horwood to champion its relaunch of Fox’s Chocolatey, which it claims is the UK’s first chocolate chip cookie sandwich.</p><p>The group made a pre-tax profit of £14.3m, marking its recovery from a pre-tax loss of £6.4m in the year to August 2024. </p><div class=\"notice-header notice-header--is-full-content-width notice-header--is-bordered\">\n<div id=\"teads\" style=\"min-height: 90px;\"></div>\n</div><p>FBC employs more than 3,800 people in the UK, having <a cmp-ltrk=\"content-container\" cmp-ltrk-idx=\"1\" data-mrf-link=\"https://www.cityam.com/sweet-success-for-biscuit-giant-behind-jammie-dodgers/\" href=\"https://www.cityam.com/sweet-success-for-biscuit-giant-behind-jammie-dodgers/\" mrfobservableid=\"7f6a61c5-3383-45f0-9543-fef8680b401e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">created</a> hundreds of new jobs last year.</p><div class=\"newsletter-auto-inject\" style=\"margin: 20px auto;\">\n<div id=\"mc_embed_shell\">\n<link href=\"//cdn-images.mailchimp.com/embedcode/classic-061523.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\"/>\n\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup\">\n<form action=\"https://cityam.us8.list-manage.com/subscribe/post?u=9a4588d00c5fa0b5c19b399c5&amp;id=7a4d10bf09&amp;f_id=00d9e5e2f0\" class=\"validate\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" method=\"post\" name=\"mc-embedded-subscribe-form\" novalidate=\"novalidate\" target=\"_blank\">\n<div id=\"mc_embed_signup_scroll\">\n<div class=\"newsletter-banner-content\">\n<h4>News Updates</h4>\n<p>Stay ahead with our three daily briefings delivering all the key market moves, top business and political stories, and incisive analysis straight to your inbox.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newsletter-form-flex\">\n<input aria-required=\"true\" class=\"required email\" id=\"mce-EMAIL\" name=\"EMAIL\" placeholder=\"Email address\" required=\"\" type=\"email\" value=\"\"/>\n<input class=\"button\" id=\"mc-embedded-subscribe\" name=\"subscribe\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Sign up\"/>\n</div>\n<!-- Hidden field to submit the dynamic category tag -->\n<input name=\"tags\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"5447797\"/>\n<div class=\"clear\" id=\"mce-responses\">\n<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-error-response\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"response\" id=\"mce-success-response\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"position: absolute; left: -5000px;\">\n<input name=\"b_9a4588d00c5fa0b5c19b399c5_7a4d10bf09\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"text\" value=\"\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</form>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div><p>The manufacturers remained the second-largest sweet biscuit makers in the UK and grew its market share to 13 per cent. </p><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-fabulous-firm-looks-to-social-media-trends\">‘Fabulous’ firm looks to social media trends</h2><p>The St Albans-based group, which also produces Party Rings and Maryland Cookies, attributed its promising results to “innovation”. </p><p>FBC was formed in a merger between Fox’s and Burton’s, both of which were bought by Italian chocolate company Ferrero.</p><div class=\"notice-header notice-header--is-full-content-width notice-header--is-bordered\">\n<div id=\"articlempu2\" style=\"min-height: 90px;\"></div>\n</div><p>Its “Fox’s Fabulous” campaign saw dance show judge Horwood don a chocolate face mask and encourage Brits to treat themselves, using his trademark “fabulous” motto.</p><p>FBC also released a “Dubai-style” variant of its Fox’s Chocolatey brand, jumping on the trend for chocolate made with pistachio cream and filo pastry which swept the UK last year.</p><p>Simon Browne, the group’s chief executive officer, said: “This financial year has been a positive year of growth across all key financial metrics, delivered through maximising the opportunities of consolidating the legacy businesses and a strong new product development pipeline.</p><p>“Despite a challenging operating environment, we have successfully outperformed the market and increased our branded sweet biscuit market share.”</p><div class=\"notice-header notice-header--is-full-content-width notice-header--is-bordered\">\n<div id=\"articlempu3\" style=\"min-height: 90px;\"></div>\n</div><aside class=\"read-more read-more--has-media read-more-auto\" data-mrf-recirculation=\"Read more\">\n<div class=\"read-more__content\">\n<h5 class=\"read-more__label\">Read more</h5>\n<h4 class=\"read-more__title\">\n<a class=\"read-more__link\" cmp-ltrk=\"Read more\" cmp-ltrk-idx=\"0\" data-mrf-link=\"https://www.cityam.com/greggs-deals-help-gerald-ronsons-forecourt-business-post-100m-profit/\" href=\"https://www.cityam.com/greggs-deals-help-gerald-ronsons-forecourt-business-post-100m-profit/\" mrfobservableid=\"d027872b-c76e-485d-9712-7fc786b5d7ed\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Greggs deals help Gerald Ronson’s forecourt business post £100m profit</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"read-more__media\">\n<div class=\"read-more__media-ratio-container\">\n<div class=\"read-more__media-item-container\">\n<img alt=\"Gerald Ronson in a suit at a business conference, gesturing during a keynote speech, engaging with the audience.\" class=\"media\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"auto\" height=\"114\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 203px) 100vw, 203px\" src=\"https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?w=203&amp;h=114&amp;crop=1\" srcset=\"https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=256,144 256w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=400,225 400w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=900,506 900w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=640,360 640w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=824,463 824w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=720,405 720w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=587,330 587w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=286,161 286w, https://www.cityam.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/gerald-ronson-e1770829094865.jpg?resize=203,114 203w\" width=\"203\"/> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</aside><div class=\"notice-header notice-header--is-full-content-width notice-header--is-bordered\">\n<div id=\"native1\" style=\"min-height: 250px;\"></div>\n</div><div id=\"primis-container-118752\"></div>\n<footer class=\"article-footer\">\n<div class=\"social article-footer__social social--is-share\">\n<p class=\"social__title\">\n\t\t\t\tShare this article\t\t\t